"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ht}_{(-)}:V^2\\rightharpoonup V\">\\(\\mathrm{ht}_{(-)}:V^2\\rightharpoonup V\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}height} \\vdash \\mathrm{ht}_T(t)\\coloneqq\\iota\\alpha\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Tree}(T,&lt;_T)\\land t\\in T\\land\\mathrm{OrderType}_S\\!\\left(\\alpha,\\{s\\in T\\mid s&lt;_Tt\\},&lt;_T\\cap\\left(\\{s\\in T\\mid s&lt;_Tt\\}\\times\\{s\\in T\\mid s&lt;_Tt\\}\\right)\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}height} \\vdash \\mathrm{ht}_T(t)\\coloneqq\\iota\\alpha\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Tree}(T,&lt;_T)\\land t\\in T\\land\\mathrm{OrderType}_S\\!\\left(\\alpha,\\{s\\in T\\mid s&lt;_Tt\\},&lt;_T\\cap\\left(\\{s\\in T\\mid s&lt;_Tt\\}\\times\\{s\\in T\\mid s&lt;_Tt\\}\\right)\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The height of a tree <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> is the supremum of successor node heights: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ht}(T)=\\sup\\{\\mathrm{ht}_T(t)+1\\mid t\\in T\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ht}(T)=\\sup\\{\\mathrm{ht}_T(t)+1\\mid t\\in T\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"f06e57c5c0b1354d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-tree.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-order-type.md","status":"resolved","id":"5d2cd56a38a81b7a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-order-type.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batc